      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1779050580417,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Internal Architecture of k8 cluster \n->The k8 cluster are a group of machine (computer) which are known as node\nwith atleast one master node and other nodes working as \"worker_node\" where \nour application is actually deployed,each woker node has a kubelet process working \non them which is the primary node agent responisible for talking to other nodes",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 8,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Internal Architecture of k8 cluster \n->The k8 cluster are a group of machine (computer) which are known as node\nwith atleast one master node and other nodes working as \"worker_node\" where \nour application is actually deployed,each woker node has a kubelet process working \non them which is the primary node agent responisible for talking to other nodes",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
